Try to change the order in which the libraries are included on the link
line. libjpeg should be later than the stuff that uses it. By the way, why
are you linking libjpeg statically instead of dynamically? Just change the
/usr/X11R6/lib/libjpeg.a to -ljpeg and put it in the end of the link line.
I think that will do it.

/Andreas

