From cbbrowne@knuth.brownes.org Sat May 24 00:54:19 1997
Message-ID: <199705240451.XAA27467@ns1.unicomp.net>
Date: Fri, 23 May 1997 23:48:09 -0500
From: Christopher B. Browne <cbbrowne@knuth.brownes.org>
Subject: Re: Red Hat update not all RPMs

> Well I've discovered that the RH install script is very picky about the
> missing RPMs even though they are NOT needed for the update.  I thought it
> would go through but then it died with an error message I couldn't
