Since this is just a debugging message for OSF/1 support, a better
change is

	if (regs.r0 != 112 && regs.r0 < 300)

which filters out all Linux system calls.  I made this change to 2.1,
and meant to get it to Erik for the 2.0.30 he shipped, but forgot.

