so quoted advisory seems to be a bit late.

This creates some problem for 4.0 users as the rpm above, at least for
Alpha, depends on libcrypt - absent on "pure" 4.0.  Maybe you can
'--force' installation, as needed symbols are probably resolved by
libc (crypt is still included there), or you can carefuly add libcrypt
to 4.0.  A prudent way to do that on 4.0 would be to get sources for this
version of wu-ftpd and recompile.  You may still need to '--force'
an installation in the future in case you would be switching to another
distribution and wu-ftpd rpm did not change in the meantime.

